        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Properties\n\nA named state contract in Twilite scripting. Follow the graph for absence/null, effective resolution, stored/computed values, and write outcomes.\n\nA declaration describes a property; it does not authorize a mutation."
        },
