        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Properties\n\nProperty identity is separate from its value. An absent value may fall through to a default; explicit null is supplied. Stored and computed values are distinct. Effective resolution records its source, and writes pass authority and validation before a change outcome is reported."
        }
      }
    },
